    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Savage Gears is a violent, single-player FPS inspired by the 2000s objective-oriented action games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with an Iron Fist and an arsenal of devastating weaponry, you play as Ero Lei'Bourne, a fearless soldier, in the middle of a dangerous conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in alternate history East Africa, you follow the journey of Ero Lei'Bourne on a Special Forces operation to thwart an arms race conspiracy ... or die trying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience intense action in the single-player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wield a range of fictional sci-fi-inspired weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Harness the power of the Iron Fist as you Smash your way through enemies in intense, first-person combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight against a dynamic range of relentless hordes of mercenaries, drones, and experimental mutant soldiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a diverse range of environments from Fort Speke to train levels to forest environments and more </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Savage Gears is a violent, single-player FPS inspired by the 2000s objective-oriented action games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with an Iron Fist and an arsenal of devastating weaponry, you play as Ero Lei'Bourne, a fearless soldier, in the middle of a dangerous conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in alternate history East Africa, you follow the journey of Ero Lei'Bourne on a Special Forces operation to thwart an arms race conspiracy ... or die trying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience intense action in the single-player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wield a range of fictional sci-fi-inspired weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Harness the power of the Iron Fist as you Smash your way through enemies in intense, first-person combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight against a dynamic range of relentless hordes of mercenaries, drones, and experimental mutant soldiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a diverse range of environments from Fort Speke to train levels to forest environments and more </p></li></ul>",
